 "traditions": [],
 "notes": "All six planned kinds kept (4 old merged one-to-one; Guitar speaker and Power attenuator new, sourced to Wikipedia). Amp modeller flat list cut from 29 to 12; Line 6 POD/Helix and Neural DSP items moved into archetype versions; BOSS ME-90, Blackstar ID:X, Headrush Prime, Hotone Ampero II Stage, IK TONEX Board, Quilter DirectAmp/Elevate, TC Combo Deluxe 65, Zoom MS-80 IR+, Strymon-only duplicates dropped as SKU noise. Ranges trimmed and VOX normalised to 'Vox'. Left out for want of a retrieved page: Ampeg 8x10 cab archetype, Marshall 1960B and Celestion G12H/G12-65/G12T-75 details, Mesa Mark III-V years, Orange OR120 as a named model (Graphic 120 used), Two Notes/Fryette/Bad Cat attenuators, IK ToneX and BOSS GX archetypes. Sweetwater pages blocked (403), not retried. Brands with 'knowledge': Fender, Roland. Founding years left blank where pages did not give them (Vox, EVH, Jensen, Kemper)."
}